Helper: [`products/static/products/js/select_fill.js`](products/static/products/js/select_fill.js) (`window.fillSelect`, `window.fillActionSelect`, `window.EMPTY_OPTION_LABEL`). Include it **before** the page script and bump `?v=` (and the branch Service Worker precache when the page is PWA-cached).
